{"4935670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DRIFT ME!", "steam_appid": 4935670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIFT ME!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist driving game about precision, flow and the perfect line. No engines to tune, no menus to fight — just you, a car, and the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/f71ae8d2b6054a34e46d7805e0819927.poster.avif?t=1788258428\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/f71ae8d2b6054a34e46d7805e0819927.webm?t=1788258428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/f71ae8d2b6054a34e46d7805e0819927.mp4?t=1788258428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beat the clock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage is a race against time. Read the layout, commit to your line, and slide through in a single clean run. Miss a beat and you restart in an instant — no loading, no punishment, just one more try.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >50 hand-crafted stages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fifty levels of gently escalating challenge, each with its own colour, rhythm and puzzle. Weave between obstacles, thread the checkpoints and chase a faster time on every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/06cfa1aafaad8e962f328b494308f274.poster.avif?t=1788258428\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/06cfa1aafaad8e962f328b494308f274.webm?t=1788258428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/06cfa1aafaad8e962f328b494308f274.mp4?t=1788258428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Soft, minimalist design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean shapes, calm colours and a tactile little drift. DRIFT ME! is built to be easy on the eyes and satisfying in the hands — a quiet, elegant game you can pick up for one run or lose an hour to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 unique time-attack stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant restarts and tight, responsive handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Keyboard and full gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm, minimalist art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn, satisfying to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your line. Beat your time. DRIFT ME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/b3f08b199a1c0a7430b3db531ca833f8.poster.avif?t=1788258428\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/b3f08b199a1c0a7430b3db531ca833f8.mp4?t=1788258428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIFT ME!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist driving game about precision, flow and the perfect line. No engines to tune, no menus to fight — just you, a car, and the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/f71ae8d2b6054a34e46d7805e0819927.poster.avif?t=17882584