agraph\" >Instant restarts and tight, responsive handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Keyboard and full gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm, minimalist art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn, satisfying to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your line. Beat your time. DRIFT ME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/b3f08b199a1c0a7430b3db531ca833f8.poster.avif?t=1788258428\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/extras/b3f08b199a1c0a7430b3db531ca833f8.mp4?t=1788258428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "DRIFT ME! is a minimalist time-attack driving game. Glide your car through 50 hand-crafted stages, weave past obstacles, clip every checkpoint and beat the clock. Calm, tactile and quietly addictive — one more run is always a single button away.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/28e1d6a541a6b129f952bb2b893c5cf9473373c0/header.jpg?t=1788258428", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/d6c486ee11234b8577739b545152e500afe1395e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788258428", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4935670/d6c486ee11234b8577739b545152e500afe1395e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788258428", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel HD Graphi